@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:security] scim-token-digest-boundary
SCIM bearer tokens MUST be compared against a persisted digest and MUST NOT be
stored, emitted in diagnostics, or returned after the one-time generation
response.

@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:recovery] scim-retirement-durable-boundary
SCIM identity and team retirement MUST remain represented by PostgreSQL state
and retryable Oban work; an endpoint response or process-local flag MUST NOT
claim final deletion.
